From 7b8baaa15f668ee458b9094039189e4450875f3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artyom Shalkhakov <artyom.shalkhakov@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:48:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NSCollectionViewFlowLayout: lay items out in lines

The flow layout placed item n of a section at n item widths from the
left, with no spacing between items, and an item that ran past the right
edge began a line of its own - every later item too, each a line of its
own, since the count of wrapped lines grew by one per item rather than
per line. Its content size was the collection view's own frame, so
nothing past the first screenful could be scrolled to. And
+[NSCollectionViewLayoutAttributes layoutAttributesForItemWithIndexPath:]
and its siblings returned nil, so a layout that used them (as AppKit's
subclasses do) gave its items no frame at all.

In -prepareLayout, place each section's items in lines, as many as fit
between the section's insets with the minimum interitem spacing between
them, the lines the minimum line spacing apart, sections one after
another; across instead of down when the scroll direction is horizontal.
The width a line has is the enclosing scroll view's content width when
there is one. Item frames and the content size are answered from that.
The delegate's spacings were never asked for: the selectors checked
were misspelt (minimim...).

Make the layout attributes the class methods promise, with their
category, kind and index path; retain the index path, release what is
held, and have -copyWithZone: return the copy it makes rather than
itself.

Mark NSCollectionViewDelegateFlowLayout's methods @optional, as AppKit's
are: a delegate that answers one of them (the item size, say) was
warned of every other one it did not implement.
---
 Headers/AppKit/NSCollectionViewFlowLayout.h  |   5 +-
 Source/NSCollectionViewFlowLayout.m          | 181 ++++++++++++-------
 Source/NSCollectionViewLayout.m              |  47 ++++-
 Tests/gui/NSCollectionViewFlowLayout/lines.m |  96 ++++++++++
 4 files changed, 250 insertions(+), 79 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Tests/gui/NSCollectionViewFlowLayout/lines.m

